ness, Investigation, Athletics<br /> <br /> <b>Homer</b><br /> Purview: Earth, Animal (Ape), Chaos<br /> Attributes: Strength, Stamina, Perception<br /> Abilities: Brawl, Animal Ken, Fortitude, Melee, Thrown, Occult (StoneCutters)<br /> <br /> <b>Glinda</b><br /> Purview: Health, Magic, Moon<br /> Attributes: Charisma, Appearance, Wits<br /> Abilities: Occult, Presence, Animal Ken, Medicine, Empathy, Integrity<br /> <br /> <b>Storm</b>:<br /> Purview: Sky<br /> Attributes: Intelligence, Wits, Charisma<br /> Abilities: Integrity, Fortitude, Empathy, Occult, Awareness, Command<br /> <br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>The Myth</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <b>Arrival Of The Gods</b><br /> The gods came from a Galaxy far far away, from a long long time ago. Captain Picard brought the gods from the stars with him above the world. He took some of the stars with him, and he placed some in the sky to keep the night from being dark. The Pony Princess Celestia brought the Sun with her to keep the world full of light during the day, and Farnsworth helped to make the world with other gods. Below the Earth, Super Mario keeps a brilliant garden of Fire Flowers, which keeps the word hot down below, and he set of magical pipes to transport into other worlds. One day, after she broke a nail, Lady Gaga went even more insane than usual, and that is what caused the world to become to be full of Chaos. Judge Judy tried to kill Lady Gaga for screaming in her ear, but Professor Farnsworth fought with her by piloting a Mecha Armor. . . Other gods got together to protect Lady Gaga and Farnsworth from dying, because no one knew what would happen if a deity passed on. After a brief struggle with the others, Judge Judy was trapped on a Hive World, where she collects the souls of certain Evil dead, and sometimes transforms them into spiders.<br /> <br /> Dr. Oz taught Mankind the science of healing, and created magical healing pools of water throughout the world. Finally, Xena brought death on the world after getting drunk. Dr. Oz face palmed and the two gods fought. Dr. Oz almost died but Superman intervened knocked her in the head until she was sober.<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> It's myths need serious work to incorporate the two Pantheons we have so far. . .<br /> <br /> I hope to receive some interest for this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":952,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/952-exdeath","user":"ExDeath","date":". 11-09-2013, 08:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/952-exdeath","name":"ExDeath","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar952_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T12:29:04-08:00","id":6967,"title":"","content":"How does Santa Claus not have Pyschopomp associated !? His Christmas Eve flight is THE pinnacle of using The Way avatar. Swap that out for Frost. He doesn't actually control snow or harden emotions.<br /> <br /> Lara Croft shouldn't have Earth or Pyschopomp associated. Maaaaaybe Mystery, but that girl is the prime example of a God who went nothing but Epics.<br /> <br /> *nerd-rage*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/606-aynie","name":"Aynie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar606_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T12:32:47-08:00","id":6969,"title":"","content":"<b>Superman</b><br /> Purviews: Guardian, Sky<br /> Attributes: Strength, Stamina, Charisma, Perception<br /> Abilities: Athletics, Awareness, Brawl, Fortitude, Integrity, Presence<br /> <br /> <b>Batman</b><br /> Purviews: Mystery, Darkness<br /> Attributes: Charisma, Manipulation, Intelligence, Wits<br /> Abilities: Brawl, Command, Empathy, Integrity, Investigation, Stealth<br /> <br /> <i>These feel a little more accurate.</i><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/484-iry","name":"Iry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar484_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"346"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T12:32:58-08:00","id":6970,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aynie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/6926-idiocracy-scion-campaign-in-idiocracy-film-setting?p=6967#post6967\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How does Santa Claus not have Pyschopomp associated !? His Christmas Eve flight is THE pinnacle of using The Way avatar. Swap that out for Frost. He doesn't actually control snow or harden emotions.<br /> <br /> Lara Croft shouldn't have Earth or Pyschopomp associated. Maaaaaybe Mystery, but that girl is the prime example of a God who went nothing but Epics.<br /> <br /> *nerd-rage*</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, well Santa Claus, did have Psychopomp. . . but I guess that I didn't write what I thought I did. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Oh well. . . um. . . Lara Croft is always in a cave or some rocky place somewhere isn't she?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/952-exdeath","name":"ExDeath","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar952_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T12:38:09-08:00","id":6973,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ExDeath</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/6926-idiocracy-scion-campaign-in-idiocracy-film-setting?p=6970#post6970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah, well Santa Claus, did have Psychopomp. . . but I guess that I didn't write what I thought I did. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Oh well. . . um. . . Lara Croft is always in a cave or some rocky place somewhere isn't she?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not actually nerd-raging. Not really. Ignore the pulsating vein of anger.<br /> <br /> I'm looking over these and while the general gist is down for each, there's nitpicking surely. And since this just seems like a fun past-time, I'm gonna nit-pick. Because.<br /> <br /> Capt. America should have War associated. Princess Celestia shouldn't have Moon because that was the domain of her younger sister and one of the key plot points in MLP. Xena shouldn't have death; she never raised zombies or consorted with the dead (that musical episode doesn't count). Judge Judy needs Justice if only so she can lay the smackdown on folks.<br /> <br /> Gaga should have Prophecy instead of Mystery. All her songs are cloaked in metaphor and meaning. Mystery's flat out bluntness.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/606-aynie","name":"Aynie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar606_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T12:56:07-08:00","id":6984,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aynie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/6926-idiocracy-scion-campaign-in-idiocracy-film-setting?p=6973#post6973\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not actually nerd-raging. Not really. Ignore the pulsating vein of anger.<br /> <br /> I'm looking over these and while the general gist is down for each, there's nitpicking surely. And since this just seems like a fun past-time, I'm gonna nit-pick. Because.<br /> <br /> Capt. America should have War associated. Princess Celestia shouldn't have Moon because that was the domain of her younger sister and one of the key plot points in MLP. Xena shouldn't have death; she never raised zombies or consorted with the dead (that musical episode doesn't count). Judge Judy needs Justice if only so she can lay the smackdown on folks.<br /> <br /> Gaga should have Prophecy instead of Mystery. All her songs are cloaked in metaphor and meaning. Mystery's flat out bluntness.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Mystery is blunt ? ? ? What's Scion?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/952-exdeath","name":"ExDeath","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar952_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T12:57:29-08:00","id":6985,"title":"","content":"Oh, well you guys forget that in Idiocracy, these people are mostly dumb and less intelligent that average people. . . Fate will have transformed the gods into other things that they are. ^_^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/952-exdeath","name":"ExDeath","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar952_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T13:20:16-08:00","id":6998,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ExDeath</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/6926-idiocracy-scion-campaign-in-idiocracy-film-setting?p=6985#post6985\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, well you guys forget that in Idiocracy, these people are mostly dumb and less intelligent that average people. . . Fate will have transformed the gods into other things that they are. ^_^</div> </div> </div> </div>True! They might as well not even be the same people. Superman could just be a fat guy who enjoys hot pockets. He's probably not even Superman, just someone who said he was and everyone believed him. Such is the nature of Idiocracy.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/484-iry","name":"Iry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar484_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"346"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-09T17:32:52-08:00","id":7115,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_poste